/FB 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 742 Tm
(1. Product Summary) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Edgecipline is an AI-powered trading journal and discipline coach for retail traders,) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 706 Tm
(starting with Forex and Indian market traders. The product lets users upload screenshots) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 692 Tm
(from their broker, automatically extracts trade details using OCR and AI, saves those) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 678 Tm
(trades into a journal, and turns the journal into actionable analytics about performance,) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 664 Tm
(psychology, setup quality, discipline, and repeated mistakes.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 650 Tm
(The core product promise is:) Tj
/FR 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 76 636 Tm
("Upload your trade screenshot. Edgecipline builds your journal, finds your) Tj
/FR 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 76 620 Tm
(patterns, and helps you become a more disciplined trader.") Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 604 Tm
(The app is not just a record-keeping tool. It is designed to help traders understand why) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 590 Tm
(they win, why they lose, when they break rules, which setups are actually working, and) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 576 Tm
(what they should focus on next.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline PRD | 3) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
